{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8af7298328fd6e00","type":"group","x":-3840,"y":-480,"width":2540,"height":1120,"label":"systems and gimmicks"},
		{"id":"784f34dba844953b","type":"group","x":-200,"y":-320,"width":1920,"height":1080,"label":"main idea and themes"},
		{"id":"db12b9b24517288c","type":"group","x":-1660,"y":-1320,"width":1060,"height":780,"label":"dev tools"},
		{"id":"dacef85ebac02475","type":"group","x":-3120,"y":-1100,"width":1380,"height":460,"label":"licenses and assets"},
		{"id":"643c2954c8cd41c5","type":"text","text":"i want to make the game based on the echo flower area in undertale","x":420,"y":163,"width":250,"height":88},
		{"id":"02a700e68081311c","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260731132750.png","x":620,"y":397,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"391a4ff715006a37","type":"text","text":"damaging system could be like undyne's chase where you only have environmental damage","x":100,"y":163,"width":250,"height":130},
		{"id":"64b11204475f7efa","type":"text","text":"pls see this when you will read this [dean ideas](<dean ideas.md>)","x":295,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":74},
		{"id":"7816bdc5017f6df5","type":"text","text":"the damaging system will require checkpoints ","x":-150,"y":337,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"16f868cef2f7c816","type":"text","text":"Theme and our ideas","x":725,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"817888fee0127a79","type":"text","text":"Chiel's idea:\nopen world with if if we find a composer or if we are not capable of it ambient noises (no music, only sound effects). because i think the theme will be night i want to do it in white and a\nblue-ish black. my aim is to a zelda type game, otherwise a non combat open world (yume nikki(again), animal crossing, stardew valley, etc.).","x":725,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":380},
		{"id":"d4cf44b596f383c3","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260731140006.png","x":100,"y":432,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"f5554cd324f86f84","type":"text","text":"we are going to use a health system that works like a battery to use idea 2 to see more of the map and have a foresight of what to come, but the main way of sight is idea 1","x":1120,"y":8,"width":250,"height":218},
		{"id":"1102e720f1a93e84","type":"text","text":"AND YES, WE KNOW, THERE IS A LOT OF UNDERTALE BUT TOBY FOX WAS JUST THAT CREATIVE!!!!!!!","x":1320,"y":-211,"width":250,"height":150},
		{"id":"b40b4b5de5a86e87","type":"text","text":"the hotlands were also a cool thing to talk about to make a little platforming section in the game","x":1420,"y":163,"width":250,"height":126},
		{"id":"2b0871d69a4c06e3","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260731133401.png","x":1120,"y":398,"width":400,"height":298},
